<!-- ═══════ CAPABILITIES ═══════ -->
<section class="cap-section" id="capabilities">
  <div class="imex-container">
    <span class="tag" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">Core Capabilities</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Everything You Need to Run<br>Intelligent Manufacturing</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">IMEX brings together data, AI, and human expertise into a composable platform built for industrial-grade performance.</p>
    <div class="cap-grid">
      <div class="cap-card"><div class="cap-icon" style="background:var(--tag-bg);color:var(--accent)">📡</div><h3>Universal Connectivity</h3><p>Connect any PLC, sensor, robot, or legacy system via OPC-UA, MQTT, Modbus, REST, and 100+ edge drivers.</p></div>
      <div class="cap-card"><div class="cap-icon" style="background:rgba(188,26,0,.08);color:var(--maroon)">🧠</div><h3>AI &amp; ML Engine</h3><p>Pre-built models for predictive maintenance, anomaly detection, demand forecasting, and process optimization.</p></div>
