      <div class="cap-card"><div class="cap-icon" style="background:var(--surface-tint);color:var(--accent-light)">👁️</div><h3>Computer Vision</h3><p>Deploy vision-based inspection, barcode reading, and spatial tracking without specialized hardware.</p></div>
      <div class="cap-card"><div class="cap-icon" style="background:rgba(255,181,71,.08);color:var(--amber)">⚙️</div><h3>Composable MES</h3><p>Modular manufacturing execution — scheduling, dispatch, WIP tracking, and genealogy that fits your process.</p></div>
      <div class="cap-card"><div class="cap-icon" style="background:var(--tag-bg);color:var(--accent)">🔒</div><h3>Security &amp; Compliance</h3><p>SOC 2, ISO 27001, 21 CFR Part 11 ready. Role-based access, audit trails, and GxP validation support.</p></div>
